      "locked": false,
      "text": "# GR3D\n    - World\n    - Network\n    - Logger\n\n---\n\n#[func]\nfn step():\n    let snapshot = World.step()\n    Network.local_peer.record_world_snapshot(snapshot)\n\n#[func]\nfn spawn( name, parent path, packed scene) -> Gd<spawned node>:\n    Network -> create_gruid()\n    spawns the provided packed scene at the parent path and renames to the given name\n    attaches generated GRUID to that node\n\n    then we call WorldDatabase record_spawn and pass in the created node\n\n#[func]\nfn despawn( Gd<RollbackObject> ):\n    NodeDatabase -> record_despawn(Gd<RollbackObject>)\n    queue_free the node\n\n\n--- private\n\n#[func]\nfn _on_physics_process():\n    Network.record_all_advantages()\n    Network.local_peer.record_inputs()\n    Network.send_updates_to_all_peers( World.time.tick )\n\n#[func]\nfn _node_editor_enter():\n    Assign ambient GRUID to the node\n\n#[func]\nfn _attach/detach_network_adapter():\n\n#[func]\nfn _attach/detach_input_adapter():",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# GR3D\n    - World\n    - Network\n    - Logger\n\n---\n\n#[func]\nfn step():\n    let snapshot = World.step()\n    Network.local_peer.record_world_snapshot(snapshot)\n\n#[func]\nfn spawn( name, parent path, packed scene) -> Gd<spawned node>:\n    Network -> create_gruid()\n    spawns the provided packed scene at the parent path and renames to the given name\n    attaches generated GRUID to that node\n\n    then we call WorldDatabase record_spawn and pass in the created node\n\n#[func]\nfn despawn( Gd<RollbackObject> ):\n    NodeDatabase -> record_despawn(Gd<RollbackObject>)\n    queue_free the node\n\n\n--- private\n\n#[func]\nfn _on_physics_process():\n    Network.record_all_advantages()\n    Network.local_peer.record_inputs()\n    Network.send_updates_to_all_peers( World.time.tick )\n\n#[func]\nfn _node_editor_enter():\n    Assign ambient GRUID to the node\n\n#[func]\nfn _attach/detach_network_adapter():\n\n#[func]\nfn _attach/detach_input_adapter():",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
