      "updated": 1743991671389,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# NodeBlueprint\n\nContains a serialized version of all relevant data about a node \n- can be used to create the object in Godot or Rapier\n- is accessed when applying actions to the world\n- is saved and restored when snapshotting\n\nBoth related:\n    - GRUID\n    - Include in snapshots?\n    - Node class (Area / Rigidbody / Collider / Character etc.)\n    - Spawn Isometry\n    - Children GRUIDs (optional)\n    - Parent GRUID (optional)\n\n\nGodot related:\n    - Node name: String\n    - Node path: String\n    - Parent path: String\n    - Resource path of spawned scene: String\n\nRapier related:\n    - Rapier handle\n    - RapierBuilder: Enum\n\n---\n\nfn get_node_ref( scene_root ) -> Gd<this Node>:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# NodeBlueprint\n\nContains a serialized version of all relevant data about a node \n- can be used to create the object in Godot or Rapier\n- is accessed when applying actions to the world\n- is saved and restored when snapshotting\n\nBoth related:\n    - GRUID\n    - Include in snapshots?\n    - Node class (Area / Rigidbody / Collider / Character etc.)\n    - Spawn Isometry\n    - Children GRUIDs (optional)\n    - Parent GRUID (optional)\n\n\nGodot related:\n    - Node name: String\n    - Node path: String\n    - Parent path: String\n    - Resource path of spawned scene: String\n\nRapier related:\n    - Rapier handle\n    - RapierBuilder: Enum\n\n---\n\nfn get_node_ref( scene_root ) -> Gd<this Node>:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
