      "text": "# Network\n\nAll network sync related logic and peer management\n\n- started: bool\n- host_starting: bool\n- adapter: Option<Gd<GR3DNetworkAdapter>>\n- local_peer: LocalPeer\n- remote_peers: Vec<RemotePeer>\n\n---\n\n#[func]\nfn get_peer_input(peer_id, tick, input_key):\n    Returns the input for the peer at tick\n\nfn send_updates_to_all_peers():\n    Assemble UpdateMessages for each peer and send them\n    via the attached NetworkAdapter\n\nfn create_gruid() -> GRUID:\n    Returns a new GRUID based on:\n        - the peer_index from GR3DNet\n        - an incrementing counter for the \n          local peer by checking local NodeDatabase\n\nfn attach_adapter( network_adapter: Gd<GR3DNetworkAdapter> ):\n    call adapter.on_attached\n    attach all network signal callbacks to # GR3D\n    set adapter to given adapter\n\nfn detach_adapter():\n    call adapter.on_detached\n    detach all network signal callbacks from # GR3D\n    set adapter to None\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# Network\n\nAll network sync related logic and peer management\n\n- started: bool\n- host_starting: bool\n- adapter: Option<Gd<GR3DNetworkAdapter>>\n- local_peer: LocalPeer\n- remote_peers: Vec<RemotePeer>\n\n---\n\n#[func]\nfn get_peer_input(peer_id, tick, input_key):\n    Returns the input for the peer at tick\n\nfn send_updates_to_all_peers():\n    Assemble UpdateMessages for each peer and send them\n    via the attached NetworkAdapter\n\nfn create_gruid() -> GRUID:\n    Returns a new GRUID based on:\n        - the peer_index from GR3DNet\n        - an incrementing counter for the \n          local peer by checking local NodeDatabase\n\nfn attach_adapter( network_adapter: Gd<GR3DNetworkAdapter> ):\n    call adapter.on_attached\n    attach all network signal callbacks to # GR3D\n    set adapter to given adapter\n\nfn detach_adapter():\n    call adapter.on_detached\n    detach all network signal callbacks from # GR3D\n    set adapter to None\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
