      "updated": 1744009250504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# Networked Input Actions\n\nUser-defined list of actions that will be synced over the network\n\nEvery physics frame, Network.local_peer.record_inputs is called, \n    - which calls local_peer.input_adapter.get_all_inputs()\n    - the result Dictionary from get_all_inputs is sorted alphabetically by input_key\n    - each value in the dictionary is serialized and pushed into a Vec<Vec<u8>>\n\nAt any time in gr3d_process of a GDScript:\n\n1. Character A on Peer A calls GR3D.is_action_pressed(\"jump\", peer_index)\n   return World::buffer::input_buffer value\n\n\nDuring a rollback, we would need to re-execute the GDScript.. \nhmm we need to provide a network_process method like GRN does - use virtual functions or all passing in Callable?\nor both!\n\nRust can check all defined actions every physics process and store them in the buffer",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# Networked Input Actions\n\nUser-defined list of actions that will be synced over the network\n\nEvery physics frame, Network.local_peer.record_inputs is called, \n    - which calls local_peer.input_adapter.get_all_inputs()\n    - the result Dictionary from get_all_inputs is sorted alphabetically by input_key\n    - each value in the dictionary is serialized and pushed into a Vec<Vec<u8>>\n\nAt any time in gr3d_process of a GDScript:\n\n1. Character A on Peer A calls GR3D.is_action_pressed(\"jump\", peer_index)\n   return World::buffer::input_buffer value\n\n\nDuring a rollback, we would need to re-execute the GDScript.. \nhmm we need to provide a network_process method like GRN does - use virtual functions or all passing in Callable?\nor both!\n\nRust can check all defined actions every physics process and store them in the buffer",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Zm19hJJXuAgbsvImCCu3c",
