      "text": "# GR3DRuntime (GDScript)\n\nRuns in-editor and at game runtime\nResponsible for anything that requires access\nto the Godot scene tree\n(GR3D cannot access the scene tree)\n\n---\n\nfn physics_process():\n    call GR3D._on_physics_process()",
